@host = http://localhost:3000/api/v1

### Cadastro válido
POST {{host}}/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Ana Souza", "email": "Ana@Example.com", "password": "senha-forte-123" }

### Mesmo e-mail de novo (esperado: 409)
POST {{host}}/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Ana Souza", "email": "ana@example.com", "password": "senha-forte-123" }

### Dados inválidos (esperado: 400)
POST {{host}}/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "A", "email": "nao-e-email", "password": "123" }

### Tentativa de virar admin (esperado: 201 com role MEMBER)
POST {{host}}/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Mallory", "email": "mallory@example.com", "password": "senha-forte-123", "role": "ADMIN" }